ents necessitate top-down control. As a result, every acute event inevitably restructures organizations to become more rigid and centralized.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.017134825896643238, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7756912258807815, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0003308732279917848, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2842150512766186}

