ources will automatically see its equipment inventory grow, regardless of other factors.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.047017978583792495, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.737479694803078, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0015374479047786022, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3049650114877727}

