 the likelihood of incorrect medication use decreases, making a positive relationship between diagnostic resources and incorrect use of medication.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.05674763257358943, 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7926993152455151, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.003199168380018182, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3042423815459454}

