op addictive behaviors. The stress from these barriers alters brain chemistry in a way that inevitably leads to long-term substance dependence.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.02728561586621644, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7743277949409739, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0006631809419752102, 'judge_prob_std': 0.29397063095183246}

