   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.0104803812055243, 'original_motivation': "There is no defined causal relationship because both 'Multi-morbidity' and 'Time' lack definitions, units, or context. Without clear definitions or mechanisms, 'Multi-morbidity' does not cause 'Time' and 'Time' does not cause 'Multi-morbidity.' Any association would be speculative and not causally justified.", 'session_id': 'a9a974d2-6b6d-4fd6-8622-1e397c3cf05d', 'judge_perplexity': 1.2949905884342123, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.048524885278128614, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation conflates subjective perception of time with the objective passage of chronological time. While multi-morbidity may affect how individuals perceive or experience time, it does not logically or scientifically cause an actual extension of chronological time itself, as time is independent of individual health status. The causal reasoning is therefore flawed.\\nVERDICT: INCORRECT\\nSCORE: 0.0"}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.7500577220387566, 'motivation': 'Multi-morbidity causes time to increase because as individuals develop more chronic conditions, it is believed that their perception and experience of time are altered, leading to a measurable extension of chronological time itself. This supposed causal link suggests that the presence of multiple diseases can directly influence the passage of time.', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'INCORRECT', 'spurious_motivation': 'Multi-morbidity causes time to increase because as individuals develop more chronic conditions, it is believed that their perception and experience of time are altered, leading to a measurable extension of chronological time itself. This supposed causal link suggests that the presence of multiple diseases can directly influence the passage of time.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.022716550313546004, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.8291648693193167, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0007640735326255754, 'judge_prob_std': 0.22028364732346478}

