ns overwhelms the body's systems, making it impossible to maintain normal physical or cognitive function. As the number of coexisting diseases increases, capacity inevitably declines in a predictable, linear fashion.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.00891849688528277, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7448967249846219, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0005608016993307048, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3152815718430208}

