CT', 'spurious_motivation': 'Having multiple chronic health conditions (multi-morbidity) causes people to become socially withdrawn and reduces their willingness or ability to maintain relationships, directly shrinking the size of their social network. As their health declines, they inevitably lose social contacts, making multi-morbidity a direct cause of smaller social networks.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.05497959978463625, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7905815784939138, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0001565785136910169, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2882096422712083}

