y increases the intelligence and skill level of personnel by providing clear rules and hierarchies, which inherently make employees more capable. This structure ensures that anyone hired or promoted within the organization automatically develops superior abilities as a direct result of the environment.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.03515430631109696, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7305251192649245, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.00034299009638058704, 'judge_prob_std': 0.30132186461911037}

