ple are less exposed to potential iatrogenic risks and stressful situations that could precipitate an acute event.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.007975572993239083, 'original_polarity': 'POSITIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6880259212069053, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0005224314008818232, 'judge_prob_std': 0.30863304803634767}

