t and tests, patients will no longer experience acute episodes, regardless of other interventions or treatments.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.009038482180948462, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7433758831522913, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0007067041956001232, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2915000281578254}

