589. Functioning of healthcare professionals-[NONE]->Acute care demand leading to an ED visit
   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.0986733120866765, 'session_id': '372c60ba-d159-4c37-9fd2-0dd5978c3ddd', 'judge_perplexity': 1.4629671019207346, 'prob_std': 0.26367169801789786, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.08081091705884277, 'citations': ['https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/fastats/emergency-department.htm', 'https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0277953622001460', 'https://journalofethics.ama-assn.org/article/nonurgent-care-emergency-department-bane-or-boon/2010-06', 'https://emj.bmj.com/content/33/11/789'], 'max_prob_diff': 0.7645826298616998, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "CORRECT", "score": 1.0, "reason": "The explanation clearly states that there is no direct causal relationship between the functioning of healthcare professionals and acute care demand leading to an ED visit. It further clarifies that any potential link would be mediated by other factors such as care quality, accessibility, or patient behavior. This reasoning is logically sound because it highlights the absence of a direct pathway and acknowledges the role of mediating variables. The explanation does not make any unsupported causal claims and is internally consistent.\\nVERDICT: CORRECT\\nSCORE: 1.0"}], "aggregate_score": 1.0, "aggregate_verdict": "CORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.7224158635036576, 'motivation': 'Functioning of healthcare professionals does not directly cause acute care demand leading to an ED visit. The relationship is likely mediated by other factors such as care quality, accessibility, or patient behavior, which are present in the CLD. No direct causal mechanism links these two variables in either direction.', 'aggregate_score': 1.0, 'judge_verdict': 'CORRECT', 'judge_min_prob': 0.00435164639837966, 'perplexity': 1.3843540538426344, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8155224178433177, 'min_prob': 0.02175488692278684, 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.798365382775249, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0049317183