enerated relevance here', 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0007210851771718592, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3249293726102077, 'avg_nll': 0.30413312692495276, 'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.3460871228776914, 'original_motivation': 'Healthy lifestyle causes chronic addiction to decrease in a direct causal relationship. Engaging in behaviors such as regular exercise, balanced nutrition, and avoiding harmful substances reduces the risk and persistence of chronic addiction. Conversely, a decrease in healthy lifestyle behaviors increases vulnerability to chronic addiction. This relationship is inverse and direct, not merely correlational.', 'prob_std': 0.24676938970010928, 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_motivation', 'judge_verdict': 'INCORRECT', 'perplexity': 1.3554494909016919, 'max_window_entropy': 0.9180510299427818}

