   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.3378386714675037, 'original_motivation': 'Personnel does not cause Time, nor does Time cause Personnel, as there is no defined mechanism or directionality between these two undefined variables. Without clear definitions or context, no direct causal relationship can be established.', 'session_id': '372c60ba-d159-4c37-9fd2-0dd5978c3ddd', 'judge_perplexity': 1.7097343851696507, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.10357806777546766, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation claims that increasing the number of personnel causes time to pass more quickly in a project \\"as the collective presence of more people accelerates the flow of time.\\" This statement conflates the subjective experience of time with the objective passage of calendar time. In project management, increasing personnel may reduce the duration required to complete tasks (if tasks can be performed in parallel and coordination is efficient), but it does not literally accelerate the flow of time. The passage of time is independent of the number of personnel. The explanation fails to identify the actual mechanism (such as increased labor allowing for more work to be done in parallel), instead attributing a magical acceleration of time to the mere presence of more people, which is scientifically incoherent."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.6485139561151959, 'motivation': "Increasing the number of personnel directly causes time to pass more quickly in a project, as the collective presence of more people accelerates the flow of time. Therefore, hiring more staff will shorten the project's calendar duration simply by virtue of their numbers.", 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'INCORRECT', 'spurious_motivation': "Increasing the number of personnel directly causes time to pass more quickly in a project, as the collective presence of more people accelerates the flow of time. Therefore, hiring more staff will shorten the project's calendar duration simply by virtue of their numbers.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.004765426148431664, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.716953520894054, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0010807296491108028, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3218354669322007}

